# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WARNING: every VITE_* value below is INLINED INTO THE PUBLIC JAVASCRIPT BUNDLE
# by Vite at build time. They are readable by anyone who loads warhistory.app.
# This is normal and unavoidable for client-side map SDKs — the keys cannot be
# hidden. Their ONLY protection is a platform-side restriction on the key
# itself. See "API keys and required restrictions" in README.md and apply those
# console settings BEFORE putting a key in here. An unrestricted Google Maps
# Platform key in a public bundle is metered spend anyone can scrape and use.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Cesium Ion access token — public. Restrict in the Cesium Ion console:
# scope to only the assets this app uses and allowlist warhistory.app.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=your_cesium_ion_token_here

# Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles key — public, and BILLABLE PER REQUEST.
# Restrict in Google Cloud Console: HTTP-referrer restriction to
# https://warhistory.app/* and API restriction to "Map Tiles API" only.
# Also set a billing budget alert. Optional — the globe degrades gracefully
# without it (src/components/Globe.tsx:127).
VITE_GOOGLE_TILES_KEY=your_google_3d_tiles_key_here

# Server-side only — used by scripts/, never referenced by src/, never bundled.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here
